%%{init: {"sequence": {"wrapPadding": 18}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as Page /genbi
  participant API as /api/genbi/ask (sync)<br/>/api/genbi/tasks (async 202)
  participant EX as lib/genbi/execute.ts
  participant AC as AgentCore Runtime<br/>(genbi container, Strands)
  participant IP as In-process agent<br/>(Bedrock Converse tool loop)
  participant DP as Regional Redshift / Athena<br/>(read-only SQL)
  participant DDB as History / cards /<br/>context tables
  U->>API: Ask a question (with workspace and place)
  API->>EX: executeGenBiAsk(abortSignal, 300s ceiling)
  EX->>DDB: Grounding: business context · published datasets · short / long-term memory
  alt AgentCore wired
    EX->>AC: InvokeAgentRuntime(sessionId)
    AC->>DP: tools: list / sample / run SQL
    AC-->>EX: SQL + results + explanation
  else fallback
    EX->>IP: runGenBiAgent
    IP->>DP: same tool set
  end
  EX->>EX: SQL lineage parsing ·<br/>masking maskRows · chart suggestion<br/>
  EX->>DDB: recordGenBiHistory · append memory
  EX-->>U: Result (table / chart / SQL / _meta actual model)
  U->>DDB: Save as card · scheduled refresh<br/>= single-node platform-action<br/>on the card's regional MWAA Serverless
